# Built datasets and model artefacts.
#
# Nothing under data/ is redistributed: the MusicBrainz supplementary tables we
# derive genre features from are CC BY-NC-SA, and shipping a derived matrix
# would put a ShareAlike obligation on this repository. scripts/build_catalog.py
# rebuilds everything here from upstream dumps. See docs/data-sources.md.
data/
models/

